==================================================================================================

RISEN is a free Bootstrap 5 dark-mode resume/CV template built for
software developers, made by Xiaoying Riley at 3rd Wave Media. This
site's visual design (layout, colors, typography, components) is
adapted from Risen; all page content, copy, and code beyond the
template itself are original to this repository.

==================================================================================================


